From: Fractal Microsystems
Subject: [PATCH] H432B: add RAM53 fastboot bulk interface

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [H432B legacy board integration]

Keep EP0 diagnostics, add the standard ff/42/03 interface and stop both
interfaces before Linux handoff. Correct the S3C RX bounce-buffer cache
index and copy only received bytes. No storage write commands are added.

